---
import InsertLayout from '../../layouts/InsertLayout.astro';
---

<InsertLayout
  title="Checkout cancelled"
  description="You left the Toledo Technologies checkout without completing payment."
  noindex={true}
  heading="Checkout cancelled"
  subheading="Nothing was charged."
>
  <h2>No payment was taken</h2>
  <p>
    You left the checkout before it completed, so no charge was made and no card
    details were stored. Nothing is owed and nothing is pending.
  </p>
  <p>
    The agreed scope is unchanged and still on the table. Cancelling a checkout
    does not withdraw a quote or cancel a conversation.
  </p>

  <h2>If you cancelled deliberately</h2>
  <p>
    That is a reasonable thing to do, and it is useful to know why. If the price,
    the scope, the currency or the payment timing was wrong, tell us — those are
    all negotiable before work starts, and they are much cheaper to change now
    than after delivery.
  </p>

  <h2>If something went wrong instead</h2>
  <p>
    If the checkout failed, showed an unexpected amount, or would not accept your
    card, we would like to know. Reply to the thread where the order was agreed,
    or reach us through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you believe you were charged despite ending up here, tell us immediately.
    We verify payments directly against the payment processor and will reconcile
    it against our own records.
  </p>
</InsertLayout>
